# Product Requirements Document
## AlgoCratic Futures™ Learning Velocity Platform (LVP)
### Version 1.0 - "Operation: Growth Trajectory"

---

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

**Product Name:** The Algorithm™ Learning Management System  
**Product Type:** Gamified Educational Platform with AI-Assisted Learning  
**Target Users:** Computer Science Students (Years 2-4)  
**Duration:** One Semester (14-16 weeks)  
**Core Metric:** Learning Velocity (dy/dx, not y)

---

## PROBLEM STATEMENT

### Surface Problem (What Students See)
"The Algorithm™ demands maximum productivity from all Development Resources. Your code velocity and growth trajectory are... suboptimal."

### Actual Problem (What We're Solving)
- Students struggle with imposter syndrome and perfectionism
- AI tools create learned helplessness vs. learning acceleration  
- Traditional grading punishes failure instead of rewarding iteration
- Students don't learn real workplace collaboration patterns
- Gap between academic coding and production development

