## TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS

### Repository Structure
```
.github/
  workflows/
    growth-tracker.yml      # Calculates metrics on push
    daily-algorithm.yml     # Daily "orders" from The Algorithm
METRICS.md                  # Public leaderboard
CLAUDE.md                   # AI integration guide
.taskmaster/               # Hidden resistance materials
  docs/
    actual-help.md         # Real debugging guides
